    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Still counted a child by his clan despite centuries of unlife, Antonio has spent his career fleeing the consequences of Embracing two childer without the Council of Seven's permission: the alchemist Nigel Porter, whom he rescued from execution in Vienna, and Marie D'Richet, a young mage's daughter who used him only to join her lover Prince Marcel in undeath. Still hunted by his own clan, Antonio hides among New Orleans' outcast Kindred, aware of but estranged from his childe Nigel, whom he believes is better off without him.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Hyperactive and restless, with too many of your own problems to spare much concern for anyone else's, unless a favor is on offer.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, converted to owned Discipline Items on this Actor at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Animalism 2, Auspex 5, Celerity 1, Dominate 4, Fortitude 1, Obfuscate 2, Presence 1, Thaumaturgy 5 (Weather Control 4, Path of Conjuring 4, Movement of the Mind 3, Lure of Flames 2, Spirit Thaumaturgy 2). Antonio has developed several rituals of his own, including one that detects whether a person has ever wielded magical energies and one that raises an impenetrable black fog.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Astio Giavetti. Secretly Blood Bound to the Council of Seven. Haven: abandoned buildings outside the city limits. Secrets rating: C+.",
